  "question": "After interchanging the given two numbers and two signs what will be the values of equation (I) and (II) respectively?\n\n× and ÷, 7 and 9\n\nI. 8 × 3 ÷ 6 + 9 – 7\n\nII. 9 – 7 × 1 + 6 ÷ 3",
