  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nI. 8 × 3 ÷ 6 + 9 – 7\n\nAfter interchanging '× and ÷' and '7 and 9'\n\n__**8 ÷ 3 × 6**__ + 7 – 9\n\n⇒ __**16 + 7**__ - 9\n\n⇒ __**23 - 9**__ = **14.**\n\nII. 9 – 7 × 1 + 6 ÷ 3\n\nAfter interchanging '× and ÷' and '7 and 9'\n\n⇒ 7 – __**9 ÷ 1**__ + 6 × 3\n\n⇒ 7 – 9 + __**6 **____**×**____** 3**__\n\n⇒ __**7**__ – 9 __**+ 18**__\n\n⇒ __**25 - 9**__ = **16.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 2\".**",
